# Trivy CVE allowlist for the wolf-scanners images.
#
# Each entry is a CVE/GHSA ID, one per line. Every exception must identify an
# owner, a fixed expiry no more than 180 days away, a reason, and its image
# scope. The release workflow validates this metadata before building.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN # owner=<team/email>; expires=YYYY-MM-DD; reason=<why accepted>; images=<exact-image-scope-or-all>
#
# The release workflow validates this source and renders a separate plain
# Trivy ignore file for each scanner, fixer, runtime, proposal, and adapter
# image. An exception scoped to one image can therefore never suppress the
# same vulnerability ID in another image.
#
# CodeQL 2.26.2 is the latest bundle, but its packaged extractor/runtime
# helper artifacts still include these fixed transitive dependencies.
GHSA-r7wm-3cxj-wff9 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable jackson-core helper artifacts; images=codeql
CVE-2026-54512 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable jackson-databind helper artifacts; images=codeql
CVE-2026-54513 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable jackson-databind helper artifacts; images=codeql
CVE-2026-48109 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable MessagePack helper artifacts; images=codeql
CVE-2026-48502 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable MessagePack helper artifacts; images=codeql
CVE-2026-48506 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable MessagePack helper artifacts; images=codeql
CVE-2026-39822 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable Go helper binaries; images=codeql
CVE-2026-56852 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable Go helper binaries; images=codeql
CVE-2026-71556 # owner=scanner-platform; expires=2026-09-10; reason=latest CodeQL bundle still ships vulnerable go-git helper binary; images=codeql
